<details class="markdown-help">
    <summary>Markdown formatting</summary>
    <div class="markdown-help-body">
        <p><code>**bold**</code> · <code>*italic*</code> · <code>~~strikethrough~~</code> · <code>`code`</code></p>
        <p>Use <code>## Heading</code> for a heading, <code>- item</code> for a list, <code>&gt; quote</code> for a quotation, and <code>[label](https://example.com)</code> for a link.</p>
        <p>Put three backticks on separate lines before and after a code block. Tables are supported too. Leave a blank line between paragraphs.</p>
        <p class="markdown-help-note">HTML and embedded images are displayed as text. Links open in a new tab.</p>
    </div>
</details>
